  <div class="q-head">Questions 14–26</div>

  <div class="q-sub">Questions 14–20</div>
  <div class="q-instr"><p>Reading Passage 2 has seven paragraphs.</p><p>Choose the correct heading for each paragraph from the list of headings below.</p><p>Write the correct number, <b>i–ix</b>, in boxes 14–20 on your answer sheet.</p></div>
  <div class="headlist">
    <div class="n-title">List of Headings</div>
    <ul>
      <li><b>i</b><span>Ray’s account of his working methods</span></li>
      <li><b>ii</b><span>The botanical expert who inspired Ray</span></li>
      <li><b>iii</b><span>A succession of academic achievements</span></li>
      <li><b>iv</b><span>Ray’s informal tuition</span></li>
      <li><b>v</b><span>Ray’s appreciation of his contemporary academic culture</span></li>
